te Showcase)： 审美排列。所有配色的静物阵列，强调色彩美学。\n商品信息 (Pro Specs)： 材质、参数、等级、认证等硬核数据展示（如果是衣服可展示平铺摆拍图白底）。\n尺码/比例信息 (Size Guide)： 选购决策。通过参考物对比展示实际大小或穿搭推荐。\n模特/生活化场景 (Lifestyle)： 建立联想。产品在真实高标场景中的使用瞬间（模特按场景展示5屏，展示模特，买家秀模特）。\n细节深度展示 (Detail Macro)： 品质背书。特写缝隙、logo、按键、涂层等关键细节。\n底部服务说明 (Trust & Brand)： 品牌故事背景、专业保养/洗涤建议及售后承诺。", 0.6000000000000001, 51320009, "randomize", 4096, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 301, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "shape"